    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33301" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκψύχω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῡ]</span>, fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ξω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lose consciousness, swoon</i>, <i><span class="en">
