				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.
					4.29
				</span></i>
			; <i>give up the ghost, expire</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Babr.
				115.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Act.Ap.</u>
				5.5
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				12.23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
